form6.label10.caption="Invulnerable as new hunted (ms)"
form6.label1.caption="Classic"
form6.edit1.hint="Items the hunted gets on top of the scheme, comma separated, *n = n times. Possible: bomb, flame, goldflame, speed, kick, punch, grab, spooger, jelly, trigger."
form6.combobox4.items[1]="No items (scheme)"
form6.combobox4.items[0]="His items from before"
form6.combobox4.hint="What the old hunted starts with after his respawn: his items from before he became the hunted (they are not spread on the field when he dies), or only the start values of the scheme."
