form6.combobox2.items[1]="He stays the hunted"
form6.combobox2.items[0]="Random other player"
form6.combobox2.hint="The hunted kills himself or dies in the hurry. "He stays the hunted" only works with respawn, without respawn a random other player becomes the hunted."
form6.combobox1.items[1]="Leader (most wins)"
form6.combobox1.items[0]="Random player"
form6.combobox1.hint="Who is the hunted when a round starts. Leader = the player with the most won rounds, random on a tie."
form6.checkbox6.hint="On: a dead player comes back with all his items, they are not spread on the field. Off: he comes back with the start values of the scheme. The hunted and the old hunted follow their own rules."
form6.checkbox6.caption="Dead players keep their items"
form6.checkbox5.hint="On: the hunted also sees his own aura. Off: only the hunters see it (two players on one PC always see it)."
form6.checkbox5.caption="The hunted sees his aura"
form6.checkbox4.hint="On: a pulsing aura is drawn around the hunted."
form6.checkbox4.caption="Aura"
form6.checkbox3.hint="On: the hunted is drawn in gold."
form6.checkbox3.caption="Gold color"
form6.checkbox2.hint="On: diseases, slow and swap have no effect on the hunted, he does not get infected."
form6.checkbox2.caption="The hunted gets no diseases"
form6.checkbox1.hint="On: dead players come back after the waiting time, the round ends when the play time is over. There is no hurry then.~0Off: the normal rules, the round ends when only one player is left."
form6.checkbox1.caption="Respawn: dead players come back"
form6.caption="Game mode"
form6.button4.hint="Add an item. Items that are already in the list are greyed out, grab and spooger replace each other."
