form4.label48.caption="Fade back (ms)"
form4.label47.caption="Duration (ms)"
form4.label46.caption="Strength (%)"
form4.label45.caption="Chance of a disease item (%)"
form4.label44.caption="Some disease items turn the screen of the player white for a while."
form4.label43.caption="Works also while standing still. A bomb on the same tile stays where it is. Team mates and invulnerable players are not stunned."
form4.label42.caption="Wait before next punch (ms)"
form4.label41.caption="Max. stun time (ms)"
form4.label40.caption="Min. stun time (ms)"
form4.label4.caption="Some disease items make the player invulnerable for a random time instead of sick (not during hurry)."
form4.label39.caption="With the punch item the second action stuns an opponent standing on the tile in front of the player."
form4.label38.caption="Open after (s)"
form4.label37.caption="The teleporter tiles and the tiles next to them stay free of bricks from the start. No bombs can be placed on a teleporter, rolling bombs stop in front of it."
form4.label36.caption="Appear after (s)"
form4.label35.caption="Teleporters in the middle of the borders bring the player to the opposite border (not during hurry)."
form4.label34.caption="Arrows on the frame show the open borders, they blink 3 s before the borders open and disappear 10 s after. If the tile on the opposite side is blocked (brick, bomb), the border works like a wall. Only players go over the border."
form4.label33.caption="Players can walk over the border of the field and come out on the opposite side."
form4.label32.caption="If the time ends inside a brick, the player can only walk out of it (through further bricks only while there is no free tile next to the player). No bombs can be placed inside a brick, and the player is hit when the brick explodes."
form4.label31.caption="See-through (%)"
form4.label30.caption="Max. time (ms)"
form4.label3.caption="Max. stun time (ms)"
form4.label29.caption="Min. time (ms)"
form4.label28.caption="Chance of a disease item (%)"
form4.label27.caption="Some disease items let the player walk through destructible bricks for a random time (not during hurry)."
form4.label26.caption="Until the first step of a round every player can throw the bomb below the player like with the glove (press the first action twice). Pressing against a wall only turns, so you can aim before throwing."
