form4.checkbox9.hint="On: some disease items let the player walk through destructible bricks for a while."
form4.checkbox9.caption="Walk through bricks"
form4.checkbox8.hint="On: until the first step of a round every player can throw the bomb below the player like with the glove."
form4.checkbox8.caption="Glove at start"
form4.checkbox7.hint="Ghosts count as alive, so the round does not end when only one player is left. Allows testing ghosts with 2 players."
form4.checkbox7.caption="Ghosts count as alive (test ghosts with 2 players)"
form4.checkbox6.hint="Show the remaining hit points above each player (only if more than 1)."
form4.checkbox6.caption="Show hit points above the players"
form4.checkbox5.hint="On: test keys F1..F12 and Ins for the host and some test settings. Shows a hint to all players."
form4.checkbox5.caption="Mod test mode"
form4.checkbox4.hint="On: dead players walk around the field as ghosts and can throw bombs to get back into the game."
form4.checkbox4.caption="Ghosts"
form4.checkbox3.hint="On: players survive several hits, set per player name in the handicap table."
form4.checkbox3.caption="Hit points"
form4.checkbox26.hint="On: after the max. carry time the bomb explodes in the hands. Off: it is thrown. 2 seconds before, the bomb starts ticking."
form4.checkbox26.caption="Explode after the max. carry time"
form4.checkbox25.hint="On: only own bombs are carried, bombs of other players are thrown at once. Off: every bomb can be carried."
form4.checkbox25.caption="Carry only own bombs"
form4.checkbox24.hint="On: with the glove a player picks up the bomb below and carries it, the timer of the bomb stops meanwhile."
form4.checkbox24.caption="Carry bombs"
form4.checkbox23.hint="On: the weights below decide how often each item and each disease appears."
form4.checkbox23.caption="Items && diseases"
form4.checkbox22.hint="On: in team play the beam also hurts team mates. Off: team mates are not hurt."
form4.checkbox22.caption="Hurt team mates (friendly fire)"
form4.checkbox21.hint="On: bombs in the beam are ignited, a dud bomb just disappears. Off: the beam only stops at them."
form4.checkbox21.caption="Ignite bombs in the beam"
form4.checkbox20.hint="On: items in the beam burn at once, like with a flame. Off: the beam goes over them."
form4.checkbox20.caption="Burn items in the beam"
form4.checkbox2.hint="On: some disease items make the player invulnerable for a while instead of sick."
form4.checkbox2.caption="Positive disease"
form4.checkbox19.hint="On: some items below the bricks are flamethrowers, hold the second action to fire."
form4.checkbox19.caption="Flamethrower"
form4.checkbox18.hint="On: some items below the bricks are white bombs that turn the screens of all opponents white."
form4.checkbox18.caption="White bomb"
form4.checkbox17.hint="On: some disease items turn the screen of the player white for a while."
form4.checkbox17.caption="White screen"
form4.checkbox16.hint="On: with the punch item the second action stuns an opponent standing in front of the player."
form4.checkbox16.caption="Boxing glove"
